{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1794376114","published":"2026-11-11T05:48:48Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:16:26.934818997Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-11721","CVE-2026-13204","CVE-2026-13321"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-11721, CVE-2026-13204, CVE-2026-13321","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: a resolver accepted validly-signed NSEC records whose Next Domain Name points outside the signer's zone\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-13321.patch: reject an NSEC RRset whose Next Domain Name is outside the signer's zone (upstream 3bc7280158)\n     - CVE-2026-13321\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: named could abort on an assertion while validating an insecurity proof covered by both NSEC and NSEC3 with an RRSIG for only one of them\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-13204.patch: fail instead of asserting when no signed NSEC/NSEC3 proof is found (upstream 204fde8595)\n     - CVE-2026-13204\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: an RRSIG with fewer labels than its signer could make named synthesize a wildcard above the signer's zone and poison the cache\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-11721.patch: reject RRSIGs whose Labels field is below the signer's label count, and stop dnssec-signzone signing out-of-zone records (upstream 06778424f0 e5b16cfd1c)\n     - CVE-2026-11721","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bind9","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/bind9?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:9.11.5.P4+dfsg-5.1+deb10u11+tuxcare.els8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1794376114.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9-doc","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/bind9-doc?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:9.11.5.P4+dfsg-5.1+deb10u11+tuxcare.els8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1794376114.json"}},